  - stateId: NetworkCollapse-brief-1
    kind: 0
    panel16x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel20x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel16x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: 56ba14ba6a644ce89bfdb1a4b4f68ffd
      m_SubObjectName: CH05M03_NetworkCollapse-b-16x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    panel20x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: 56ba14ba6a644ce89bfdb1a4b4f68ffd
      m_SubObjectName: CH05M03_NetworkCollapse-b-20x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    lines:
    - lineId: network_collapse-brief-02
      textKey: narrative.network_collapse.brief-02
      englishFallback: Work through the three nodes in order. After clearing each
        guard group, hold the original engineer at its recon marker for six seconds.
        That confirms the node for Attack. After the third node, bring the engineer
        to the audit custody marker and hold for six seconds.
      speaker: 3
      voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      femaleVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      neutralVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      startSeconds: 0
      deadlineSeconds: 18.928572
      essentialCaption: 1
    continueStateId: NetworkCollapse-brief-2
    skipStateId: NetworkCollapse-brief-complete
    reducedMotionSupported: 1
    durationSeconds: 18.928572
    motionPreset: 0
    locationTitleKey: 
    locationTitleFallback: 
    locationSubtitleKey: 
    locationSubtitleFallback: 
    musicCue: 0
    ambienceCue: 0
    vehicleCue: 0
    eventCue: 3
    routeRole: 0
    completionPayloadId: 
    evidenceIds: []
    missionContextFlags: []
  - stateId: NetworkCollapse-brief-2
    kind: 0
    panel16x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel20x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel16x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: 56ba14ba6a644ce89bfdb1a4b4f68ffd
      m_SubObjectName: CH05M03_NetworkCollapse-c-16x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    panel20x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: 56ba14ba6a644ce89bfdb1a4b4f68ffd
      m_SubObjectName: CH05M03_NetworkCollapse-c-20x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    lines:
    - lineId: network_collapse-brief-03
      textKey: narrative.network_collapse.brief-03
      englishFallback: Protect both civic buildings, their staff, the original engineer
        and the APC. Once the audit is secured, board the engineer into the APC and
        move to the marked extraction point. Hold there for six seconds. Preserving
        the people and the proof is part of the same mission.
      speaker: 2
      voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      femaleVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      neutralVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      startSeconds: 0
      deadlineSeconds: 19.285715
      essentialCaption: 1
